<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL -- Augat vaults higher.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL -- Augat vaults higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Augat Inc jumped ahead of the opening of trading on the U.S. stock market on Monday, sparked by news that the company would be acquired by Thomas &amp; Betts Corp for about $550 million of stock.</p>
<p>Shares of Augat climbed to 25-5/8. The stock closed on Friday at 20-7/8.</p>
<p>The merger would exchange each Augat share for 0.68 of a share of Thomas &amp; Betts, subject to a collar and certain adjustments.</p>
</text>
